  "text": "Intake note (Commercial team, 19/02/2023). Our client Neha Menon is a 48-year-old farmer who lives at Flat 11B, Sitabuldi, Nagpur 440035 and can be reached on 08923428939 or neha.menon@example.com. The client's PAN MZVPM3800S.\nThe client consulted us about a cheque bounce matter against Kavya Kulkarni. A cheque for ₹25,20,000 issued by Kavya Kulkarni bounced: the cheque came back with the remark account closed.\nThe cheque was deposited in the client's account no. 580557634181 (IFSC ICIC0719043).\nThe matter was filed as S.C.C. No. 851/2023 before the Judicial Magistrate First Class Court at Nagpur on 30 June 2023.",
